@startuml
!theme plain
title 共乘與代買明細管理系統 - 概念架構圖

actor "一般成員" as Member
actor "車主" as Owner

package "共乘與代買明細管理系統" {
  component [身份選擇] as Login
  component [共乘紀錄模組] as CarpoolModule
  component [代買紀錄模組] as PurchaseModule
  component [付款狀態管理] as PaymentStatus
  component [月結算提示模組] as ReminderModule
  component [成員名單管理] as MemberMgmt

  database "共乘與代買資料儲存" as Storage
}

Member --> Login
Owner --> Login

Login --> CarpoolModule
Login --> PurchaseModule

Member --> CarpoolModule : 登記自己的共乘紀錄
Owner --> CarpoolModule : 查看所有人共乘紀錄

Member --> PurchaseModule : 發起代買/查看代買清單
Owner --> PurchaseModule : 發起代買/查看代買清單

Member --> PaymentStatus : 標記自己已付款
Owner --> PaymentStatus : 標記自己已付款

Owner --> MemberMgmt : 新增/刪除成員

CarpoolModule --> Storage
PurchaseModule --> Storage
PaymentStatus --> Storage
MemberMgmt --> Storage

ReminderModule --> Storage : 檢查本月是否有未付款紀錄
ReminderModule --> Member : 顯示「本月尚未結算」提示
ReminderModule --> Owner : 顯示「本月尚未結算」提示

@enduml
